// Public EdDSA key for Sparkle update verification. Written by scripts/setup-release-secrets.sh.
// Empty until MacAuth's OWN key pair exists (generate_keys --account macauth). It must never be the
// MacMonitor key: scripts/release.sh and setup-release-secrets.sh refuse that. Without a key the app
// builds and runs, but its updater stays off, and scripts/release.sh aborts.
SPARKLE_PUBLIC_ED_KEY =
